bundle

# Vim swap files (vimrc and gvimrc now live in vim/).
.*.sw[a-p]
vim/.*.sw[a-p]

# LanguageTool is a vendored binary tree (~600 MB), so it is not versioned.
# Both vim/vimrc and nvim/lua/plugins/writing.lua expect the jar at
# $HOME/devzone/vim-config/LanguageTool-5.9/languagetool-commandline.jar
# On a fresh clone, download the archive from https://languagetool.org/download/
# and unzip it here, or update those two paths to the version you install.
LanguageTool-5.9/
LanguageTool-6.0/
